title: astra/1
subtitle: A Language for Historical Astronomical Models and the Geometrical Reasoning about Them
running-title: astra/1 — models and derivations
author:
- name: Gerd Graßhoff
  email: gerd.grasshoff@hu-berlin.de
  orcid: 0000-0002-4450-357X
